    {
        "text": "The massive machine sits silent in the darkness."
    },
    {
        "text": "The intertwining tubes are like sprawling rhizomes, shoots growing out at the ends."
    },
    {
        "text": "Each shoot is an electrode glowing faintly, absorbing nutrition from the lifeform underneath."
    },
    {
        "text": "The missing Pioneers lie side by side, electrodes on their heads."
    },
    {
        "text": "They breathe and their hearts beat, but they are oblivious to what is happening around them."
    },
    {
        "text": "A silvery liquid flows through the tubes, converging on the device at the center of the room."
    },
    {
        "text": "It seems more alive than the dozens of catatonic test subjects."
    },
    {
        "text": "How could this be...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Helen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
