    },
    {
        "text": "Are you sure you want to meet with him alone, Miss Franks?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I have permission from the bureau."
    },
    {
        "text": "They say that man, Loken Williams, is a complete nutjob. He got a hundred years in prison for his cruel human experimentation."
    },
    {
        "text": "I know. I've sat in his lectures before."
    },
    {
        "text": "These scientists are out of their minds... oh, sorry, I forgot you were a scientist too. But you're such a gentle and elegant lady. Surely you're not like them!"
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand. Thank you for being concerned about my safety. I'll be careful."
    },
    {
        "text": "How long do you expect you'll be in there?"
    },
    {
        "text": "An hour. I can come back again same time next week, if necessary."
    },
    {
        "text": "You want to talk to him that badly? He doesn't usually care about other people..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe it's because of all the things people ask him for, I'm the only one asking for help."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
