        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Synchronization failed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mechanist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The situation at Site 359 may be worse than we thought.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mechanist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#7",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Uhh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#7",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Are you alright?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for the help, Dr. {@nickname}.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can feel my legs now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Site 359 is about more than just Rhine Lab.;Ferdinand is working with more powerful forces.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know who Ferdinand is working with, don't you, Saria?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "text": "The power armor you've been tracking just might end up in the hands of those who most need cutting-edge weaponry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've seen them. Evidence?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll have it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "That warmth I felt back there, that was a little wishful thinky on my part, huh? I put my life on the line to get the evidence you wanted.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_532_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our hypothesis was right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_532_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ferdinand is no longer hiding his ambition.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "He's leveraging this experiment to garner support...",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "...and he'll use it to seize control of Rhine Lab.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have to find Kristen. She is Ferdinand's prime target.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you get my last message, Saria?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "My contacts inside Rhine say everything is normal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's because they're used to Control's absence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ferdinand's been planning this for years, undermining Control's authority, little by little... this experiment is the last step.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or maybe not the last one...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hadn't been in contact with Kristen for a week before they got me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about the site?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mechanist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wouldn't be too worried about Dr. Silence. I still remember that time she got the upper hand of me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_532_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is no time for indecision, Saria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have to make a choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is no multiple choice question, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_532_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The key to resolving the situation at the site is Ferdinand, and the key to taking care of Ferdinand lies before us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Let's go see the Control of Rhine.",
        "values": 1
    },
